{{!
  Domain event: an immutable record of something that happened, published through the DomainEventPublisher port
  (common-domain) by the use case after the change is saved; adapters listen to it (search indexing, cache).
  Publish it from the use case: inject DomainEventPublisher and call domainEventPublisher.publish(new <Name>(...))
  after the save; verify(domainEventPublisher).publish(...) in its test.
  Exemplars: dashboard-usecase .../events/PageCreatedEvent.java, .../usecase/CreateOrUpdateDynamicPageUseCase.java
  Target: <capability>-usecase/src/main/java/<pkg>/events/<Name>Event.java
  Package: "package" is the full package of the file (no suffix is appended).
  Vars:   package, Name (everything before "Event", e.g. GadgetCreated), domainPackage, Aggregate, aggregate
  Left to you: the listener in the adapter, the publish call in the use case.
}}
